ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Combat Casting|TYPE:General.DragonShamanBonus|DESC:You are adept at spellcasting when threatened or distracted.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Disruptive|TYPE:Combat|DESC:Your training makes it difficult for enemy spellcasters to safely cast spells near you.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Greater Spell Penetration|TYPE:General.MendevianPriest|DESC:Your spells break through spell resistance much more easily than most.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Improved Initiative|TYPE:Combat.CloakedWolfBonusFeat.SharkShamanBonus|DESC:Your quick reflexes allow you to react quickly to danger.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Spell Penetration|TYPE:General.DragonShamanBonus.MendevianPriest|DESC:Your spells break through spell resistance more easily than most.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Spellbreaker|TYPE:Combat|DESC:You can strike at enemy spellcasters who fail to cast defensively when you threaten them.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Weapon Finesse|TYPE:Combat|DESC:You are trained in using your agility in melee combat, as opposed to brute strength.
ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Weapon Focus|APPLIEDTO:Rapier|TYPE:Combat.WeaponFocus.OracleWeaponMastery|DESC:You are especially good at using your chosen weapon.
